# Lettera - AI Cover Letter Generator

## Project Structure
This is a monorepo using pnpm workspaces with:
- Frontend: React 19 + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS 4 + shadcn/ui
- Backend: NestJS + Prisma + PostgreSQL

## Code Style
- Use TypeScript for all new code
- Follow ESLint and Prettier configurations in packages/eslint-config
- Use functional components and hooks in React
- Use dependency injection in NestJS

## Path Aliases
Frontend:
- @/components -> src/components
- @/lib -> src/lib

## Database
- Use Prisma for all database operations
- Run migrations after schema changes: pnpm prisma:migrate
- Generate client after schema changes: pnpm prisma:generate

## UI Components
- Use shadcn/ui components from src/components/ui
- Install new components: npx shadcn@latest add [component-name]
- Use Tailwind utility classes with the cn() helper

## Commands
- pnpm dev - Start both frontend and backend
- pnpm build - Build both applications
- pnpm lint - Run linting
- pnpm format - Format code
- pnpm typecheck - Check TypeScript types
